---
layout: base.njk
title: Events — CHIRP Radio
description: Upcoming CHIRP Radio events, DJ nights, fundraisers, and benefits.
permalink: /events/
---

<h1>Events</h1>
<p>Where to catch CHIRP in person.</p>

{% if cms.events.length %}
<ul class="articles-list">
{% for event in cms.events %}
  <li>
    <h3><a href="/events/{{ event.slug }}/">{{ event.title }}</a></h3>
    <div class="meta">
      {{ event.date | chicagoDateLong }}
      {% if event.venue and event.venue.name %} · {{ event.venue.name }}{% endif %}
      {% if event.venue and event.venue.city %}, {{ event.venue.city }}{% if event.venue.state %}, {{ event.venue.state }}{% endif %}{% endif %}
    </div>
    {% if event.excerpt %}<div class="excerpt">{{ event.excerpt }}</div>{% endif %}
  </li>
{% endfor %}
</ul>
{% else %}
<p>No upcoming events right now — check back soon.</p>
{% endif %}
